{"text":"kuruntokai","n":109,"lines":["முட்கால் இறவின் முடங்குபுறப் பெருங்கிளை","புணரி இகுதிரை தரூஉந் துறைவன்","புணரிய இருந்த ஞான்றும்","இன்னது மன்னோ நன்னுதற் கவினே"],"tr":["muṭkāl iṟaviṉ muṭaṅkupuṟap peruṅkiḷai","puṇari ikutirai tarūun tuṟaivaṉ","puṇariya irunta ñāṉṟum","iṉṉatu maṉṉō naṉṉutaṟ kaviṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"நம்பி குட்டுவனார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Nampi Kuṭṭuvaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 7, veṇṭaḷai 6, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"முட்கால்","tr":"muṭkāl","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முட்","tr":"muṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கால்","tr":"kāl"}]},{"text":"இறவின்","tr":"iṟaviṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இற","tr":"iṟa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வின்","tr":"viṉ"}]},{"text":"முடங்குபுறப்","tr":"muṭaṅkupuṟap","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முடங்","tr":"muṭaṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குபு","tr":"kupu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றப்","tr":"ṟap"}]},{"text":"பெருங்கிளை","tr":"peruṅkiḷai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருங்","tr":"peruṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிளை","tr":"kiḷai"}]}],[{"text":"புணரி","tr":"puṇari","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புண","tr":"puṇa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரி","tr":"ri"}]},{"text":"இகுதிரை","tr":"ikutirai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இகு","tr":"iku"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திரை","tr":"tirai"}]},{"text":"தரூஉந்","tr":"tarūun","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தரூ","tr":"tarū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"உந்","tr":"un"}]},{"text":"துறைவன்","tr":"tuṟaivaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வன்","tr":"vaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"புணரிய","tr":"puṇariya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புண","tr":"puṇa"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரிய","tr":"riya"}]},{"text":"இருந்த","tr":"irunta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இருந்","tr":"irun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"ஞான்றும்","tr":"ñāṉṟum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஞான்","tr":"ñāṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றும்","tr":"ṟum"}]}],[{"text":"இன்னது","tr":"iṉṉatu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னது","tr":"ṉatu"}]},{"text":"மன்னோ","tr":"maṉṉō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"}]},{"text":"நன்னுதற்","tr":"naṉṉutaṟ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னுதற்","tr":"ṉutaṟ"}]},{"text":"கவினே","tr":"kaviṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவி","tr":"kavi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"முட்கால்","parts":[{"text":"முள்","lemma":"muḷ","gloss":"thorn"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"kāl","gloss":"leg"}],"gloss":"thorny-legged"},{"surface":"இறவின்","parts":[{"text":"இறவு","lemma":"iṟavu","gloss":"shrimp"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of (genitive)"}],"gloss":"of the shrimp"},{"surface":"முடங்குபுறப்","parts":[{"text":"முடங்குபுறப்","lemma":"முடங்குபுறப்","gloss":"bent-backed"}],"gloss":"bent-backed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெருங்கிளை","parts":[{"text":"பெருங்கிளை","lemma":"பெருங்கிளை","gloss":"large swarm"}],"gloss":"large swarm","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புணரி","parts":[{"text":"புணரி","lemma":"puṇari","gloss":"ocean"}],"gloss":"ocean"},{"surface":"இகுதிரை","parts":[{"text":"இகு","lemma":"iku","gloss":"crashing"},{"text":"திரை","lemma":"tirai","gloss":"wave"}],"gloss":"crashing wave"},{"surface":"தரூஉந்","parts":[{"text":"தரூஉந்","lemma":"தரூஉந்","gloss":"bringing"}],"gloss":"bringing","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துறைவன்","parts":[{"text":"துறை","lemma":"tuṟai","gloss":"shore"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"lord of the shore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புணரிய","parts":[{"text":"புணரிய","lemma":"புணரிய","gloss":"having united"}],"gloss":"having united","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இருந்த","parts":[{"text":"இருந்த","lemma":"இருந்த","gloss":"that was"}],"gloss":"that was","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஞான்றும்","parts":[{"text":"ஞான்று","lemma":"ñāṉṟu","gloss":"day/time"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even/also"}],"gloss":"even on the day"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னது","parts":[{"text":"இன்னது","lemma":"iṉṉatu","gloss":"like this"}],"gloss":"like this"},{"surface":"மன்னோ","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"maṉ","gloss":"indeed"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"alas"}],"gloss":"indeed, alas"},{"surface":"நன்னுதற்","parts":[{"text":"நன்னுதற்","lemma":"நன்னுதற்","gloss":"of the beautiful forehead"}],"gloss":"of the beautiful forehead","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவினே","parts":[{"text":"கவின்","lemma":"kaviṉ","gloss":"beauty"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the beauty indeed"}]}],"literal":"Thorny-legged shrimp's bent-backed large swarm / ocean's crashing wave brings, the lord of the shore / when they united, even on the day / like this indeed, alas, was the beautiful forehead's beauty!","translation":"O lord of the maritime shore, where the crashing waves of the ocean bring large swarms of bent-backed, thorny-legged shrimp! Even on the days when you were united with her, the beauty of her lovely forehead was just like this—pale and troubled with the fear of your departure.","modern":"முட்கள் போன்ற கால்களையும் வளைந்த முதுகையும் உடைய இறால்களின் பெரிய கூட்டத்தை, கடலின் கரையை நோக்கி வீசும் அலைகள் கொண்டு வந்து சேர்க்கும் நெய்தல் நிலத் தலைவனே! நீ அவளோடு கூடி இருந்த நாட்களிலும் கூட, அவளுடைய அழகான நெற்றியின் அழகு இப்படித்தான் பிரிவை அஞ்சிப் பசலை படர்ந்து இருந்தது!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Neytal (seashore) landscape, where the heroine's friend (toḻi) addresses the hero (tuṟaivaṉ). She points out that the heroine's suffering is not new; even during their moments of union, her forehead lost its luster and looked pale because she was constantly anxious about his impending departure. The natural imagery of the crashing waves bringing a large swarm of bent-backed, thorny-legged shrimp to the shore mirrors the heroine's state. Just as the relentless waves push the shrimp onto the shore, the constant thoughts of separation crash upon her mind, leaving her bent with grief even when they are together. Key words that carry this emotion are 'puṇariya irunta ñāṉṟum' (even on the days they were united) and 'iṉṉatu' (like this, pale and anxious).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.46],[1.46,2.0],[2.0,2.48],[2.48,3.12],[3.12,3.76],[3.76,4.4],[4.4,4.8],[4.8,5.2],[5.2,5.5],[5.5,5.8],[5.8,6.1],[6.1,6.4],[6.4,6.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.57],[1.57,2.2],[2.2,3.0],[3.05,3.5],[3.5,3.95],[3.95,4.4],[4.4,4.9],[4.9,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.6],[6.6,6.9]]},"sync":[[["முட்கால்","thorny-legged"]],[["இறவின்","of the shrimp"]],[["முடங்குபுறப்","bent-backed"]],[["பெருங்கிளை","large swarm"]],[["புணரி","ocean"]],[["இகுதிரை","crashing wave"]],[["தரூஉந்","bringing"]],[["துறைவன்","lord of the shore"]],[["புணரிய","having united"]],[["இருந்த","that was"]],[["ஞான்றும்","even on the day"]],[["இன்னது","like this"]],[["மன்னோ","indeed, alas"]],[["நன்னுதற்","of the beautiful forehead"]],[["கவினே","the beauty indeed"]]]}